From 850b345510566a6d20daac92e80c3f19f5354f83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Signbot AutoDL <zhengsw200304@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 07:17:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Remove leaked wandb key, hardcoded user paths; fix resume
 std size and play.py defaults

- train.py: drop the author's hardcoded WANDB_API_KEY; log offline unless the
  user configured wandb; use absolute log dir; save the linker config.
- helpers.py: no default wandb entity (was the author's account).
- logger.py: hardcoded /home/guanren savefig path.
- task_registry.py: reset_std used a hardcoded 21 actions -> --resume crashed
  for the 55-action linker-hand policy.
- play.py: num_envs was hardcoded to 884; logs resolved relative to cwd.
- base_task.py: keep a graphics device in headless mode when recording video.
